# app/ios/Podfile is CocoaPods configuration (Ruby syntax, no .rb extension), not
# Ruby source. Without this, GitHub's language detection counts it as Ruby, and
# CodeQL's default setup then adds an "Analyze (ruby)" job to every push that
# fails fatally ("no source code for Ruby seen") because there is nothing for
# the Ruby extractor to analyze. Vendored files are excluded from language
# stats, which is what default setup keys off.
app/ios/Podfile linguist-vendored
